\subsection{Temporal Graphs and Recurrent Communities}
Define a time-varying graph $$ G_t=(V,E_t,w_t) $$ with $$ V=\mathcal{V} $$ and edge weights $$ w_t(u,v) $$ given by context-conditioned co-occurrence or attention.
