Let $$ T $$ be the transjective endofunctor of Â§ 1.
Then $$ T $$ acts sheaf-wise by post-composition on restriction maps,
$$ T(\rho_{UV}) = G\!\circ\!\rho_{UV}\!\circ\!F, $$
